https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5wSztvWhx14

section 1: setup
step 1: initiate npm
create a folder locally and open it in VS code
open terminal in VS code and run $ npm init -y, it will create package.json file (-y: select yes on all the upcoming questions)

step 2: install Playwright test
$ npm init playwright@latest

step 3: create tests file
create a file under 'tests' folder and name it in this format 'blabla.spec.js' ('blabla.spec.ts' if use typescript), that's where we add tests in


section 2: create tests
$ npx playwright codegen <url that you are testing>

